sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Kubeflow
    participant CLI as thub CLI
    participant Registry as AlgorithmRegistry
    participant TorchRun as torchrun subprocess
    participant GPU as Local GPU (CUDA)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant CkptDir as Checkpoint Dir<br/>(Local / PVC)
    participant S3 as S3 / Remote Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Engine<br/>(Co-located)
    participant LiteLLM as litellm<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: SFT / OSFT / LoRA Distributed Training
        User->>CLI: thub sft --config train.yaml
        CLI->>Registry: Resolve algorithm + backend
        Registry->>TorchRun: Spawn torchrun workers
        TorchRun->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>TorchRun: Model artifacts
        TorchRun->>GPU: Training forward/backward pass<br/>CUDA kernels
        GPU-->>TorchRun: Gradients
        TorchRun->>CkptDir: Save checkpoint
        CkptDir->>S3: Mirror checkpoint (optional)<br/>Auth: AWS IAM
        TorchRun-->>CLI: Training complete
        CLI-->>User: Results + metrics
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,vLLM: Flow 2: GRPO Reinforcement Learning (verl backend)
        User->>CLI: thub grpo --backend verl
        CLI->>Registry: Resolve GRPO + verl backend
        Registry->>TorchRun: Spawn torchrun (FSDP workers)
        TorchRun->>vLLM: Generate rollouts (in-process)
        vLLM-->>TorchRun: Rollout responses
        TorchRun->>GPU: GRPO training (FSDP sharded)<br/>NCCL communication
        GPU-->>TorchRun: Updated weights
        TorchRun->>CkptDir: Save checkpoint
        TorchRun-->>CLI: Training complete
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User,MLflow: Flow 3: GEPA Prompt Optimization
        User->>CLI: thub gepa --config gepa.yaml
        CLI->>Registry: Resolve GEPA algorithm
        loop Evolutionary generations
            Registry->>LiteLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: OPENAI_API_KEY
            LiteLLM-->>Registry: LLM responses
            Registry->>Registry: Evaluate + Pareto selection
        end
        Registry->>MLflow: Log experiment (optional)
        Registry-->>CLI: Optimized prompts
        CLI-->>User: Best prompts + scores
    end
